OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and bright day with a mix
OL,6,Fof sunny spells and the odd coastal
OL,7,Fshower possible. After a cool start,
OL,8,Ftemperatures climbing to around
OL,9,Faverage in the sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA bright end to the day with
OL,12,Fsunny spells this evening. Remaining
OL,13,Fdry overnight with clear spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping. Rather chilly,
OL,15,Fparticularly in rural spots.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FDry and settled for most on
OL,18,FSunday, with plenty of late August
OL,19,Fsunshine on offer. Light winds and
OL,20,Ffeeling warm in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
